  provenanceClassification:'USER_ASSERTION: application purpose, architecture, constraints, prohibitions, and success conditions. USER_OBSERVATION: the obsolete interface was instruction-centric and the retained project had been framed around implementation history. USER_SUPPLIED_DATA: exact 31-stage sequence, 20 Stage 1 scopes, information-class definitions, and deployment target. USER_SUPPLIED_DOCUMENT: corrected complete build instruction. USER_SUPPLIED_URL: configured GitHub Pages URL and repository. PRIOR_AGENT_OUTPUT: prior project descriptions and conclusions, retained only as workflow history. EXISTING_WORK_PRODUCT: repository files and earlier deployed artifacts. CANDIDATE_ARTIFACT: frozen application candidates. OTHER_USER_SUPPLIED_INPUT: connected tools and required operating conditions.',
