  requiredOutputProperties:'A standalone UTF-8 HTML application titled Closed-Loop Agent Reliability; no public version label; five primary views for Projects, Job, Workflow, Records, and Release; an exact 31-stage manifest; all 20 Stage 1 fields; structured information-class registries; work-owner fields; current-schema JSON import/export; a visible retained self-verification project; exact product bytes and SHA-256; an ACCEPTED decision; matching audited and release hashes; and deployment at the configured URL.',
